OL,3,GNEWSA'Murdered teen's legacy inspired
OL,4,Amy legal career'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bursary is a tribute to 18-year-old
OL,7,FAnthony, who had ambitions to study law
OL,8,Fbut was murdered in a racist attack on
OL,9,FMerseyside in 2005.
OL,11,FUche said she had been inspired by his
OL,12,Ffamily's fight for justice and wanted
OL,13,Fto draw on Anthony's own values when
OL,14,Fbuilding her career.
